{
  "_meta": {
    "description": "Dialogue data for Old Maren (Retired Engineer / Elder). Seasonal/daily pool + heart milestones.",
    "version": "1.0",
    "objective": "#33 Complete NPC Dialogue"
  },
  "entries": [
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_001",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "weather": "CLEAR",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Come in, dear. I've made tea. The kind with the mint — or was it chamomile?",
          "portrait": "happy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_002",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "weather": "RAIN",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Rain again. My joints know before the sky does, these days.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_003",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "The garden's coming along. Oren always said spring was for planting hope.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_004",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "weather": "CLEAR",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "What a lovely day. Reminds me of... hmm. Something nice.",
          "portrait": "happy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_005",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "weather": "RAIN",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Stay dry, dear. Wet clothes lead to cold bones. Trust an old woman.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_006",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "I found one of Oren's notebooks yesterday. His handwriting was terrible. I miss it.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_007",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "weather": "CLEAR",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Autumn light through the window. Golden. Like honey. Like memory.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_008",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "weather": "RAIN",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Quiet days are good for remembering. And for soup.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_009",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "The Harvest Faire reminds me of when this town was just four families and a well.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_010",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "weather": "CLEAR",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Bundle up, dear. The cold doesn't announce itself politely.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_011",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "weather": "SNOW",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Snow covers everything equally. Scars and gardens alike.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_012",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Remembrance Day. I remember too much some days. Not enough on others.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_013",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "weather": "STORM",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Storms like this... Oren used to hold my hand during them. Silly old man.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_014",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "weather": "FOG",
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 6,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Fog makes the town look like a dream. Or a memory. Same thing, at my age.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_015",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "My Oren used to say the machines would outlast us all. He was right about the machines.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_016",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Have you eaten today, dear? You work too hard. Just like Oren.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_017",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "The AI Core... Oren didn't find it by accident. He was LOOKING for it.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_018",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Pip visited today. She reminds me of someone. I can't remember who.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_019",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "I made extra biscuits. Take some to Spark. That girl forgets to eat.",
          "portrait": "happy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_020",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "My memory isn't what it was. But I remember the important things. Mostly.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_021",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Listen carefully, Jack. The journal — have you read it all? There are coded parts.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_022",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Some days are clearer than others. Today is... medium.",
          "portrait": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_023",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "The cherry blossoms remind me of our wedding day. Or was that dogwood?",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_024",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "You're a good boy, Jack. This town needed you. Even if they don't all say it.",
          "portrait": "happy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_sd_025",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 5,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Tea's on the stove. Sit. Tell me about your machines.",
          "portrait": "happy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_hm_02",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 2
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_maren_milestone_2",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Here, dear. Oren's old toolkit. You'll put it to better use than my shelf.",
          "portrait": "happy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_hm_04",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 4
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_maren_milestone_4",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "You remind me of him. Oren. The way you look at machines — like they're alive.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_hm_06",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 6
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_maren_milestone_6",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "I have something to tell you. About the AI Core. About what Oren really found.",
          "portrait": "determined"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_hm_08",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 8
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_maren_milestone_8",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "You've become family, Jack. This old woman doesn't say that lightly.",
          "portrait": "happy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_hm_10",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "heart_milestone",
      "conditions": {
        "hearts_eq": 10
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "one_time": true,
      "story_flag_set": "npc_maren_milestone_10",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Take care of Coppervale when I'm gone. And take care of DEJIN. Promise me.",
          "portrait": "thoughtful"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_y2_spring_031",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "New people coming through town. Reminds me of the early days, when Oren and I first arrived. So much hope.",
          "portrait": "nostalgic"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_y2_summer_032",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SUMMER",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "The bunker... Oren searched for that place for years. He'd be so pleased you found it, dear.",
          "portrait": "gentle"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_y2_autumn_033",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "I've survived worse than a bully with a radio. My Oren faced down raiders when this town was nothing but tents.",
          "portrait": "steely"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_y2_winter_034",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "year_gte": 2,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 9,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Be careful in that siege, dear. This old woman still needs her engineer.",
          "portrait": "worried_loving"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_y3_spring_035",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "year_gte": 3,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "I'm tired more often now. But I can still see the Overlook from my window. Still beautiful.",
          "portrait": "content"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_y3_autumn_036",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "AUTUMN",
        "year_gte": 3,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "You did it, Jack. You really did it. Oren is smiling somewhere. I can feel it.",
          "portrait": "peaceful_tears"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_y3_winter_037",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "WINTER",
        "year_gte": 3,
        "hearts_gte": 0
      },
      "priority": 10,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "This is my last Remembrance Day, I think. But what a beautiful one to end on.",
          "portrait": "serene"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "entry_id": "npc_maren_y4_spring_038",
      "npc_id": "npc_maren",
      "category": "seasonal_daily",
      "conditions": {
        "season": "SPRING",
        "year_gte": 4,
        "hearts_gte": 0,
        "story_flag": "flag_main_story_complete"
      },
      "priority": 11,
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc_maren",
          "text": "Every sunrise is a gift now, dear. And this town... this town is the best gift of all.",
          "portrait": "grateful"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}